{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras/GrippersVRTitle.png?t=1745510692\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gripper's is leaping into VR</strong> \u2014 bringing over 40 mind-bending puzzles designed to test your wits and reflexes in a whole new dimension!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you reach the treasure at the end?</strong><br>Each level challenges you to think creatively and make the most of your environment \u2014 all in full VR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Puzzle Highlights:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use blocks to block enemy sightlines and sneak your way through</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn defeated enemies into makeshift rafts to cross water</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master teleportation mechanics to move yourself, blocks, and other objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect every key to unlock the exit and advance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All-new VR controls let you zoom in and out for a fresh perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 40 handcrafted puzzles, with more on the way post-launch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minimal hand-holding for a rewarding challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A quirky, fun story with charming characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by a beloved classic game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Free puzzle updates and new modes coming soon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're a puzzle master or just getting started, <i>Gripper's VR</i> will pull you in with its clever mechanics and imaginative world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/extras/GrippersWaving.png?t=1745510692\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Blob your first Squirrel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/af84f717bcee1656f6a45f129f268580858cf42f.jpg"},{"name":"Blob your first Monster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/11313bbb547b601586e3b366b00f983b971254ed.jpg"},{"name":"Hit your First Target","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/e9cb48d470413e7770e448f36e4e1f9cf6371e27.jpg"},{"name":"Completed 10 Puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/4731292b0e6e0b645c3de8815b24ec8590b3617d.jpg"},{"name":"Completed 20 Puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/4731292b0e6e0b645c3de8815b24ec8590b3617d.jpg"},{"name":"Completed 30 Puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/4731292b0e6e0b645c3de8815b24ec8590b3617d.jpg"},{"name":"Find the treasure","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/4245ba4d7c2a57f18afb4059d134aeaa8057b1c3.jpg"},{"name":"Surf's Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/23e248d8f16091675c1895104618c4d1ece6f0ae.jpg"},{"name":"Ouch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3549440/e0236997f5c0dd428ca879ec6280c9cc38e63bb0.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549440?t=1745510692","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549440?t=1745510692","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549440/dd0e5e2b1d52553122246547391e6945